WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.870
It was a short while, but thank you for everything.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.310
You're already leaving?

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.010
Um, I will come back again.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.310
You have to. Promise me.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.580
Yes.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.080
Excuse me, may I ask one thing?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.720
That time, when we were fighting.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.390
Why didn't you help Yoko?

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.760
Well, let's see...
She said it herself, right?

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.760
That there's no need to inform me.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.500
Just because of that?

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.970
You didn't think she was acting tough or trying not to worry you?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.870
No way.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:47.010
She's a wild animal, so she won't pick a losing fight.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:51.610
And besides, it's a fight among Inukami, or rather, women.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.580
I'd just get in the way.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.890
How can you trust her that much?

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.260
Well, it's because
I'm her master, right?

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:11.000
I painfully understood from our previous fight with Yoko.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.040
We are still lacking in training.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.310
Just by understanding that, all of you have grown.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:20.510
Gosh!

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:26.920
Just remembering that is so vexing it hurts my chest!

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.890
Well, there's no need to be depressed just because you lost to Yoko.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:34.060
You know, right?

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.330
The power of an Inukami

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.300
depends on the total power of their Inukami User.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:44.370
That's why Master Kaoru has all ten of us, right?

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.270
As expected of Master Kaoru.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:50.410
He's totally different from
Master Keita who only has Yoko.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:56.250
Sayoka. Then do you mean my master's power is below Master Kaoru?

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:04.050
Why does the head of the Inukami Users

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.060
only have me as her Inukami?

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:08.460
Well...

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.800
She doesn't need anybody else other than me.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.840
I eliminated other Inukami and took this position.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.440
Just like Yoko.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.910
But why did Yoko pick Master Keita?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.210
I'm curious too.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.720
That's right.
All the other Inukami ignored him.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.480
So why did she choose him?

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.050
Well...

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.360
I wonder why.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.470
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.870
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:02:53.870 --> 00:03:00.740
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:17.260
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:24.100
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:30.710
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:38.680
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:43.450
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:47.190
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:50.490
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:56.200
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:00.600
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.840
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:09.910
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.020
Keita and Yoko!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.820
"Keita and Yoko!"
Keita and Yoko!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:15.980
Keita and Yoko!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.850
A few months before

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.190
What?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.860
Someone wants to be my Inukami?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.290
Where is she?

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.560
Where is my cute Inukami?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.130
Come on out.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.100
Be quiet.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.900
She's not here.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:32.940
Darn.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:33.940
Why?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.270
You seem pretty happy.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.640
Of course I am.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.780
I was rejected by them once.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.150
Two full days off per week, and there's bonus pay.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.180
It will be a bright workplace with no secrets.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.420
I gave them such nice conditions,

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.560
but no Inukami came.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.960
And I got kicked out of the Kawahira family.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.530
I guess I should've touched on benefits too.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.300
You fool!

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:09.470
An Inukami's true nature is to vanquish evil.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:13.540
They wish to exterminate evils harming this world

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.180
together with us, Inukami Users.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.980
But you treated it like a part-time job.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.820
Ever since this family started,

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.350
you're the only one who couldn't get an Inukami.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.620
I'm tired of hearing that lecture.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.390
So, where is she?

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.830
The old temple at the mountain.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.500
You really wish to be an Inukami User?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.270
Of course.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.370
I'll get a handy Inukami like Hake, right?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.170
It's pretty inconvenient living alone.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:47.240
Aren't you misunderstanding what an Inukami User is?

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:51.580
First, our ancestor,
Ekai Kawahira was...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.150
Right, I'll be off!

00:05:53.150 --> 00:06:05.430
Here I come, my cute Inukami.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:08.860
Here I am.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:14.870
Hey, I'm here!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:21.980
Where is she?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.280
Hey, your master is here.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.900
Hey, hurry and show up, you mutt.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.900
Geez, where is she?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.610
Are you my Inukami?

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:03.590
Yes.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.920
It's here.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.860
Finally!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.360
It took long...

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.900
So much training since I was a kid.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.300
No fun, no girlfriends.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:21.140
Almost died a lot, but still couldn't be an Inukami User.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.540
They said I was a disgrace.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.580
But I'm finally getting an Inukami.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.750
Please take good care of me.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.850
Yes. Today is a celebratory day.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.890
From tonight on, she will cook, massage my shoulders...

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:41.160
Maybe service me at night too?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.330
Hurray!

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.330
Well first, what is your name?

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.100
You don't remember?

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.530
What do you mean?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.800
My name is Yoko.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.810
Is that so? I'm Keita Kawahira.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:01.610
I will be your master.
Call me Master Keita.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:02.910
Understood.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.680
Let's get the master and servant vow done with.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:07.780
Vow?

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.350
Yeah, the User and the Inukami

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.220
exchange one of their belongings to form a contract.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.830
But you don't have anything.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:18.990
All right.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:20.730
Here.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.600
For now, this will be your belonging.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:29.470
I'll go look in the city for a fitting necklace...

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:32.910
I mean, a collar, and we'll exchange that.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.310
After that, a doggy handshake.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:39.520
But I cannot go outside the mountain's barrier.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:43.290
Oh, don't worry.
As long as you have that chain,

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.020
you can move around the mountain freely.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.660
Freely, huh?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.930
All right, let's do the doggy handshake.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.230
Come on, shake.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.540
I need water!

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.600
Here, water.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.810
What was that all about?

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:18.190
Enough of your nonsense.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.420
Master Keita.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.890
What?

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.930
You stayed quiet, but listen to you.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.830
Massages and night services?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.670
You wouldn't want to take this great Yoko so lightly.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.800
You're just a mere human.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.440
But I wanted to play outside.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.410
So I'll let it slide.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:43.310
In any case, you are my master in name only.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.920
You know, there are things
I've wanted to do.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.350
First, take me to Tokyo Tower.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:52.350
After that, I want to eat a chocolate cake.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.720
After that...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:58.230
Are you listening?
Tokyo Tower and chocolate cake!

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.360
Hey, come on!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.230
Don't you mess with me!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:06.000
What? You won't take care of me?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.240
You've got it backwards!
You are supposed to take care of me!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.210
What's that? That is so stupid.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.610
Very well.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.050
I'll teach you respect for humans!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.780
It's getting fun.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:25.450
Shut up, you stupid mutt!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.320
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.960
Frog, smash your enemy!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.130
All right.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.770
You missed!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:39.970
Darn you.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.570
Evil Fire.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:47.440
What?

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.380
Teleport.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.050
Is he dead?

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.860
You're pretty tough.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.430
Then this won't kill you, right?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.200
Evil Blaze.

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:26.750
"Inukami!"

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.350
Woof woof.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.430
What is this?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.700
Sorry, Grandma.
I burned down the temple.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.200
Don't burn it.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.540
Say it to that mad dog.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.240
But she ran off somewhere.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.210
Probably to the city.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:54.380
City?

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:59.480
Yes. She, Yoko, has always wanted to visit the city.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:00.980
I see.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:06.050
All right, I'll find her and beat in the greatness of humans.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.960
Then please take this with you.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.960
What is that?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:12.190
It has Yoko's weakness.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:16.670
Really? You should've just gave it to me in the first place.

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:20.870
I won't tell you why, but even among us Inukami,

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.840
Yoko is treated differently.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:27.280
For a long while, she was separated from the others.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.210
That is why

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:33.780
although she has powers, she lacks the correct Inukami mindset.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.790
Don't hand me over some defect like that.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.290
I'm sorry.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:42.660
But I have high hopes for you,
Master Keita.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.400
Would you teach Yoko human common sense,

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:50.970
and train her into a full-fledged Inukami?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.730
Of course.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:57.170
I'll capture her and train her to be just my type of Inukami.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.780
First, the collar.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.650
Listen, Keita. Make sure to find Yoko.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.550
You don't have any time to waste.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.080
The Inukami User and their Inukami

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:12.750
share each other's spiritual powers through a contract.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.660
It increases their power.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.560
But now you have lost your Inukami.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:22.900
And since only one of you has made the contract,

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.770
you will keep losing your powers.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:25.870
Look.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.210
Dark spirits of the forest.
They're all targeting you.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.520
It's because your spiritual power is very weak.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.020
At this rate, you will die.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:45.990
Seriously?

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.020
They're coming.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.260
Leave this place to me.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.500
Hurry, go. Be careful.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:59.270
Thanks.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.810
Purification Barrier Type 2.
Purple Pillar!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:13.680
He sure is troublesome.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.220
Where did that puppy go?

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.090
What is that?

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.500
Our merchandise!

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:37.010
Oh, that was fun.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.910
It's her!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.010
I'll get you!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.760
It's so delicious.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:59.060
How many years since my last one?

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:05.400
I never forgot...

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.400
That idiot.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.000
Training fanatic

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.840
I found you, you evil demon!

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.440
You haven't learned your lesson?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.680
Shut up!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.450
I'm going to train you now.
Be prepared!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.650
I'll never be afraid of you.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:27.560
I'm giving you one more chance.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.530
If you surrender and swear loyalty,
I will forgive you.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.460
How's that?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.800
Well, this is my answer.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:43.840
That's my line.
Surrender and swear loyalty to me.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:46.010
Right now!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.840
Don't get so cocky.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:54.220
I brought an item made especially to counter you.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.650
Teleport.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.220
You idiot.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:05.530
Now then, I wonder what you brought.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.700
No!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.340
No, stay away!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.540
Stop licking there!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.910
You fell for it. Here.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.840
No!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:27.120
You really are weird.
An Inukami that's afraid of dogs.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.680
Shut up!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.020
Excuse me?

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.190
No. That's right, I'm so sorry!

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:35.860
Not there...

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:38.160
Where? Will you listen to me?

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:41.800
I'll listen!
I'll listen to whatever you say!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.500
So put it away!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.500
All right, then first.
As a symbol of your obedience.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.470
I'll do anything.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.910
I'll listen to whatever you say.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:59.350
So take this dog away, please!

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:01.350
Fine.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.860
Look. I put it away.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.190
Hey, do you hate dogs that much?

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.870
Hey.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.670
I'm sorry.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:27.880
Now that I think about it,
I should've thanked you.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:32.350
If you hadn't come,
I wouldn't be an Inukami User.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:36.820
No, I'm also sorry for being selfish.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.160
- What?
- They're here.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:49.060
Hey, Yoko!

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.570
Form a contract with me.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.370
What should I do?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.610
A certain someone bullied me a lot.

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:00.980
This isn't the time!
You're also being targeted!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.310
In that case...

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.080
They're coming.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.850
Will you swear loyalty to me?

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:12.790
Will you become mine?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:16.690
If you do that, then I will save you.

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:19.260
Nonsense! Who would do that?

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:21.660
Is that so? Good bye then.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.670
Okay. I get it.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.970
I will be yours.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:28.900
Very well.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.240
Hey.

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.440
That's my belonging I'll give.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.810
I'll take good care of you, Keita.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.290
Evil Blaze!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.230
They're nothing.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.400
You idiot!
You're making a huge fire!

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:59.930
It's all right, I'll bring water.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.440
Teleport...

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.070
Hey, what's wrong?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.910
I think I used too much power.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.950
What?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:15.650
Hey, can't you use Teleport at least once more?

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.050
If it's close enough to touch...

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.320
All right then, hang on tight!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:33.970
Now, Yoko.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:35.670
Okay.

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.010
Teleport!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:47.920
We're saved.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.190
You were amazing, Keita.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.890
You too.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:55.860
Keita!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.230
Hey.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:20:00.160
As I thought, you really are interesting.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.760
What do you mean, "as I thought?"

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.070
Don't mind it.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.900
One day, I will make you remember it.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.710
Huh? Nadeshiko?

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.520
Going home already?

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:26.250
Yes. It was short, but thank you for taking care of me.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:29.360
That's right, we really took care of you.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:32.230
Next time you come, bring souvenirs.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:33.800
I will.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.160
Yoko.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:39.200
Oh, this? Keita did this.

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:42.970
He was waiting with first aid kits.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:46.840
As expected,
Master Keita is interesting.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.880
Right? But I won't give him to you.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.280
Because he only belongs to me.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.720
See you.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.820
I'm back, Keita.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.150
Welcome home.

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:06.190
What are you doing, you stupid mutt?

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:10.600
You're the stupid one!
You're hiding weird DVDs again!

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:13.370
Shut up! It's none of your business!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.170
Wait!

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.670
Why would I wait, you stupid mutt?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.370
Prepare yourself!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:23.180
No! Not jail!

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:24.950
Jail?

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:42.960
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:48.370
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:53.540
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:58.950
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:01.950
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:07.160
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:10.490
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:21.500
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:23.870
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:32.780
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:35.520
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:41.690
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:51.130 --> 00:22:53.840
Inukami!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:54.870
See you!

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.240
Next episode preview

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.270
As he ran, Melos almost gave up for a slight second.

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:03.240
And Selinuntius started to doubt Melos.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:07.880
"Selinuntius, punch me." "No, Melos. You punch me."

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:10.150
The naked men punched each other.

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:13.350
And then the naked men held each other tightly.

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.220
They are both splendid perverts.

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:18.330
Tightly Tomohane!
Next on Inukami.

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:20.390
"Tightly Tomohane!"

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:23.600
Is it friendship? Or is it love?
